5,1,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I want to make sure we don't make people too tired. I will look into the staffing of the coordination group and in-house developer availability.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I agree we should be careful. I'll examine the network coverage at customer plants and the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,"I shall look into the capital budget and software allowance, as well as vendor licence pricing versus fixed-fee work.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm curious about the patterns here. I'll check the outcomes of the last three internal rollouts and the record of cross-unit standardization efforts.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to see what's actually happening on the floor. I'll look into the time lost to copying existing records and misrouted deliveries in the incident logs.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
